{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>地震中能夠保命的關鍵，往往在震前已經決定。QuakeSafe Earthquake Safety 正圍繞這個想法設計，讓人預先知道該做甚麼、備妥所需物品，並在事後與家人互相確認安全。它適合居住於地震帶的家庭與住戶使用，原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>地震前必學的保命步驟</h2>\n<p>應用按室內、戶外、車廂與高樓等情境提供逐步應變指引，重點步驟清楚標示，數秒內即可讀完。地震包清單會追蹤水、藥物與電池的到期日，在過期前提醒你，也備有事後家居檢查流程。地震警示整合 AFAD、EMSC 與 USGS，只通知 200 公里內的地震，並可在沒有網絡時以藍牙向家人報平安。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-21-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-22-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-23-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-24-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-25-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-26-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：QuakeSafe Earthquake Safety</li>\n<li>應用類別：Weather</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T23:38:58.255128+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":341,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}